# F3: Migration/Upgrade Test Verification Report

**Date:** 2026-04-01
**Task:** Test upgrading existing native install to sentinel mode
**Method:** Static analysis of installer-v6.sh code
**Status:** REJECTED ❌

---

## Executive Summary

The migration from native mode to sentinel mode has a **CRITICAL FAILURE** that will cause complete data loss for existing installations.

**Root Cause:** The installer generates NEW secrets during migration instead of preserving existing ones from the .env file.

**Impact:** All existing data encrypted with old secrets (keystore.db, Matrix rooms, etc.) will become permanently inaccessible.

**Verdict:** REJECT - Migration is unsafe for production use.

